  "description": "Add a touch of classic romance to your designs with this collection of Valentine’s Day Harlequin diamond backgrounds. Featuring 12 unique color palettes—ranging from traditional reds and sweet pastels to luxury gold and modern pop art—these geometric patterns are ideal for greeting cards, digital wallpapers, and seasonal creative projects.\nSPECIFICATIONS\n• 4000 x 4000 pixel\n• 300 DPI\n• 12 JPG files\n• 12 EPS\n• 12 SVG\n• 12 PDF\n• CMYK color mode\nIDEAS FOR FILE USE\n• T-shirt designs\n• Card making\n• Children’s room prints\n• Design for pillows\n• Eco-friendly bag\n• Coffee and tea-eating designs\n• Can be printed at your local copy shop (greeting cards, mugs, pillows, etc.)\nThank you very much for stopping by!",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Add a touch of classic romance to your designs with this collection of Valentine’s Day Harlequin diamond backgrounds. Featuring 12 unique color palettes—ranging from traditional reds and sweet pastels to luxury gold and modern pop art—these geometric patterns are ideal for greeting cards, digital wallpapers, and seasonal creative projects.</p>\n<p>SPECIFICATIONS<br>\n• 4000 x 4000 pixel<br>\n• 300 DPI<br>\n• 12 JPG files<br>\n• 12 EPS<br>\n• 12 SVG<br>\n• 12 PDF<br>\n• CMYK color mode</p>\n<p>IDEAS FOR FILE USE<br>\n• T-shirt designs<br>\n• Card making<br>\n• Children’s room prints<br>\n• Design for pillows<br>\n• Eco-friendly bag<br>\n• Coffee and tea-eating designs<br>\n• Can be printed at your local copy shop (greeting cards, mugs, pillows, etc.)</p>\n<p>Thank you very much for stopping by!</p>",
